            <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-3 cfedFooter__ornamentColumn">
                <img alt="" class="cfedFooter__ornament" src="/-/media/admin/images/footer/chicagofedseal-png.svg?sc_lang=en&amp;hash=E4AB87F37CC95CE4152B4298195AB481" />
                <div>Our Values
                    <hr />
